self.KB_CONTENT["card:756678"]={"id":"card:756678","ty":"card","sourceId":"756678","title":"『品號資料建立作業』中的『屬性內容二 (MB144)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"品號","keywords":["品號","狀態","屬性"],"y":"other","answer":"* 新增狀態才可輸入；修改狀態則不可輸入。* 可點選(icon)或[F2]屬性定義值查詢。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
