self.KB_CONTENT["card:755132"]={"id":"card:755132","ty":"card","sourceId":"755132","title":"『客戶品號對照表』中的『Email (C 1)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"品號","keywords":["品號","客戶","傳送"],"y":"other","answer":"* 有購買「FAX/Email處理系統(FEP)」時，「Email」選項才可輸入。* 預設未勾選。* 當「Email」為打勾時，「選擇Email傳送方式」才可輸入。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
